Spec: SpecDD Syntax Highlighter Factory

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Create syntax highlighters for SpecDD files through IntelliJ extension registration.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDSyntaxHighlighterFactory.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDSyntaxHighlighterFactory.kt

Can read:
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/highlighting/SpecDDSyntaxHighlighterFactoryBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Extend IntelliJ `@SyntaxHighlighterFactory`.
  Return a new `@SpecDDSyntaxHighlighter` from `getSyntaxHighlighter`.
  Accept nullable project and virtual-file inputs.
  Stay stateless.
  Cover factory creation behavior in tests.

Must not:
  Implement tokenization rules.
  Define highlighting colors.
  Report validation diagnostics.
  Add user-facing settings.
